<title>JAPAN: Kikusui Electronics -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kikusui Electronics -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.14		vs	    3.85</p>
<p> Operating	  231    million	  vs	  166    million</p>
<p> Current	    205    million	  vs	  116    million</p>
<p> Net		  194    million	  vs	  107    million</p>
<p> EPS		   19.63 yen	  vs	   10.84 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kikusui Electronics Corp is a manufacturer and importer/exporter of electrical machinery appliances.</p>
